{% doc %}
  The search's `options[unavailable_products]`: "last" while theme settings › מוצרים שאזלו "מוצרים שאזלו מוצגים
  באתר" is on (sold-out products after the available ones, Shopify's own order), else "hide" (never listed). Every
  search link and form of the theme prints it here, and layout/theme.liquid sends any other value to it. Prints the
  bare word (callers put it in a URL or an attribute).

  @example
  <input type="hidden" name="options[unavailable_products]" value="{% render 'search-unavailable' %}">
{% enddoc -%}
{%- if settings.sold_out_visible -%}last{%- else -%}hide{%- endif -%}
